					<li><span class="font-medium text-slate-800">Vendor:</span> Zebra Technologies</li>
					<li><span class="font-medium text-slate-800">Components:</span> 2 (componentOne, componentTwo)</li>
					<li><span class="font-medium text-slate-800">Context:</span> <span class="font-mono">zebra_vision_documentation</span></li>
